      <container name="Taking note" eId="container_2">
        <p xml:space="preserve">	<span class="italic">Taking note</span> of Economic and Social Commission for Asia and the Pacific decision 82/24 of 24 April 2026, by which the Commission decided that its eighty-third session would be held in Shanghai, China, from 26 to 30 April 2027,</p>
