    <mainBody>
      <paragraph eId="para_3" class="SingleTxt">
        <content eId="para_3__content">
          <p xml:space="preserve">	<span class="italic">Approves</span> the holding of the eighty-third session of the Economic and Social Commission for Asia and the Pacific in Shanghai, China, under the theme “ESCAP at 80: navigating paradigm shifts, promoting connectivity and accelerating sustainable development in Asia and the Pacific”.</p>
